    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir18">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e98">Caput 18</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_1@1-4">Qui vivit in aeternum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir18-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir18-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Rerum substantia simul creata est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">magnitudinem virtutis scire vel enarrare: unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e119" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt11_27@9-24">Nemo novit Filium nisi Pater, neque Patrem quis novit nisi Filius, et cui voluerit Filius revelare</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e125">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e127">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e129">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e131" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_5@1-3">Non est minuere.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir18-Rd1e134"><name xml:id="gom-sir18-Nd1e135" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e138">Nihil de Scripturis sanctis est minuendum, nihil addendum: unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e140" source="http://scta.info/resource/ap22_18@9-22">Si quis apposuerit ad haec, apponet super illum Deus plagas scriptas in libro isto</quote>, etc.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e146">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e148">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e150">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e152" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_8@5-6">Centum anni.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir18-Rd1e155"><name xml:id="gom-sir18-Nd1e156" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e159">Paucitatem dierum nostrorum comparat guttae maris, et calculo <pb ed="#P" n="1202A"/> arenae: quia ad comparationem aeternae felicitatis nimia est brevitas, et miseria maxima: unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e163" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob14_1@1-10">Homo natus de muliere, brevi vivens tempore, repletur multis miseriis</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e169">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e171">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e173">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e175" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_12@1-2">Miseratio hominis.</quote>
            Pauci sunt, qui misereantur proximo: cum misericordia Dei redundat per universum mundum, qui solem suum facit oriri super bonos et malos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e183">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_14@2-3">Excipiens doctrinam.</quote>
            Hortatur eos qui doctrinam Evangelii accipiunt, ut misericordiam proximis impendant: et festinent diem judicii misericordiae operibus praevenire; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e190" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt5_7@1-6">Beati misericordes, quoniam ipsi misericordiam consequentur</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e195">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e197">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e199">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_15@13-14">Verbi mali.</quote>
            Lingua eucharis gratiosum <pb ed="#P" n="1202B"/> hominem facit; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e206" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov17_27@1-8">Qui moderatur sermones suos doctus et prudens est</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e211">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e213">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e215">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e217" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_16@1-2">Nonne ardorem.</quote>
            Segetes defendit ros ab ardore solis: et verbum bonum largientem a nequitia irascentis; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e220" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov15_1@5-7">Sermo durus suscitat rixas, lenis mitigat suscitatas</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e225">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e227">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e229">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e231" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_18@1-3">Stultus acriter improperabit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir18-Rd1e234"><name xml:id="gom-sir18-Nd1e235" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e238"><seg type="qs">In ore stulti jurgia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">polluunt verbo mendaci.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e247">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e249">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e251">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e253" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_19@3-4">Para justitiam.</quote>
            Ut videas quid in te Deo placeat vel displaceat, et delicta corrigas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e258">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e260">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e262">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e264" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_20@6-7">Ante judicium.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir18-Rd1e267"><name xml:id="gom-sir18-Nd1e268" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e271">Haec monent ut semper parati simus, nec stulta securitate nobis blandiamur: sed in Dei servitute laboremus usque ad finem vitae.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e276">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e278">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e280">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1202C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e284" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_23@1-2">Ante orationem.</quote>
            Cum stabis ad orandum, dimitte si quid habeas adversus aliquem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e289">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e291">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e293">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e295" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_24@1-1">Memento.</quote>
            Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e298" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps10_8@2-11">Justus Dominus, et justitias dilexit: aequitatem vidit vultus ejus</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e303">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e305">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e307">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e309" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_25@2-2">Paupertatis.</quote>
            Futurae post hanc vitam, ut facias amicos qui recipiant te in aeterna tabernacula.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e314">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e316">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e318">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e320" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_26@9-10">Haec omnia.</quote>
            Ver, aestas, autumnus, hiems, dies et nox, nunquam omnia requiescunt; et tamen omnia aeternitati comparata cito transeunt: et omnia coram oculis Domini certo fine clauduntur. Ipse autem semper idem est, et anni ejus non deficient.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e325">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e327">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e329">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e331" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_27@1-2">Homo sapiens.</quote>
            Beatus est homo qui semper est pavidus ut a peccatis suis caveat, et praecepta <pb ed="#P" n="1202D"/> Domini impleat: Quia <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e336" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps110_10@1-10">initium sapientiae timor Domini. Intellectus bonus omnibus facientibus eum</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e341">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e343">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e345">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e347" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_28@6-6">Invenienti.</quote>
            Id est, cum invenerit, et agnitionem ejus perceperit, ipsa dabit confessionem rectae praedicationis, et studium bonae operationis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e353">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e355">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e357">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e359" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_29@1-1">Sensati.</quote>
            Quasi astuti agnoscunt sapientiam, et sensati in verbis opere demonstrant prudentiam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir18-Dd1e364">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir18-Hd1e366">Versus 33</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir18-d1e368">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir18-Qd1e370" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir18_33@1-3">Ne fueris mediocris.</quote>
            Provocat nos ad opera misericordiae. Si enim pigri fuerimus, non modo deerunt nobis solatia temporalia, imo animae nostrae bona futura: quando temporalis eleemosyna remunerabitur mercede aeterna.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
